entity_id_fix.description:
**{count} entities** have an entity_id that doesn't follow the stable Comexio scheme (server, extension, IO / marker / KNX id — independent of the display name). Example: {example}

Fixing renames them. **History and statistics move along automatically.** Automations, scripts and dashboards are **not** updated — **at least {references} automations/scripts** (? = could not be checked) currently reference these entity IDs and must be adjusted afterwards; please check dashboards as well. Entity IDs you renamed manually are renamed too.

